1
00:00:16,534 --> 00:00:22,869
(Firefly Theater)

2
00:00:43,456 --> 00:00:47,392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

3
00:00:49,024 --> 00:00:52,608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

4
00:00:53,184 --> 00:00:55,520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

5
00:00:55,904 --> 00:00:58,656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

6
00:00:59,488 --> 00:01:02,080
♪I've seen this game before♪

7
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:04,768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

8
00:01:04,768 --> 00:01:07,168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

9
00:01:07,552 --> 00:01:10,304
♪Just an empty shell♪

10
00:01:10,624 --> 00:01:13,440
♪I've broken this game before♪

11
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:15,872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

12
00:01:15,872 --> 00:01:18,016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

13
00:01:18,208 --> 00:01:25,056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

14
00:01:25,728 --> 00:01:28,256
♪When I stand back up again♪

15
00:01:28,544 --> 00:01:30,400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

16
00:01:31,264 --> 00:01:33,952
♪For the part you owe me♪

17
00:01:34,112 --> 00:01:41,088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

18
00:01:42,624 --> 00:01:47,360
♪You're just my starting point♪

19
00:01:51,712 --> 00:01:52,739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

20
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,720
=Episode 5=

21
00:01:57,790 --> 00:01:58,349
Zi.

22
00:01:58,989 --> 00:02:00,189
We overlooked someone.

23
00:02:00,469 --> 00:02:01,030
Who is it?

24
00:02:01,710 --> 00:02:02,389
Ms. Hui.

25
00:02:04,510 --> 00:02:05,430
Tell me,

26
00:02:05,870 --> 00:02:06,870
could she be

27
00:02:06,950 --> 00:02:08,069
Di Liren's relative,

28
00:02:08,550 --> 00:02:09,469
or an acquaintance

29
00:02:09,469 --> 00:02:10,870
from his hometown?

30
00:02:11,949 --> 00:02:13,030
Why do you say that?

31
00:02:13,229 --> 00:02:14,150
The nurse told me

32
00:02:14,310 --> 00:02:15,550
Liren's phone was broken,

33
00:02:15,590 --> 00:02:16,789
yet he just took

34
00:02:16,789 --> 00:02:17,469
Ms. Hui's phone

35
00:02:17,509 --> 00:02:18,430
to make a video call.

36
00:02:18,550 --> 00:02:19,749
Who would he call?

37
00:02:20,310 --> 00:02:21,789
Zhang Tao? Chen Chen?

38
00:02:22,390 --> 00:02:23,229
Impossible.

39
00:02:23,430 --> 00:02:24,909
Ms. Hui doesn't have their WeChat.

40
00:02:26,229 --> 00:02:27,909
Then who could she contact?

41
00:02:28,870 --> 00:02:29,749
Only your parents.

42
00:02:30,189 --> 00:02:31,110
But their phones

43
00:02:31,150 --> 00:02:31,870
were with me,

44
00:02:31,949 --> 00:02:32,830
and they didn't ring.

45
00:02:33,469 --> 00:02:34,229
That proves it.

46
00:02:34,949 --> 00:02:36,390
It means Di Liren

47
00:02:36,830 --> 00:02:38,509
and Ms. Hui share a mutual friend,

48
00:02:38,669 --> 00:02:40,030
who matters

49
00:02:40,069 --> 00:02:41,110
a great deal to Di Liren.

50
00:02:41,629 --> 00:02:42,189
Listen.

51
00:02:42,629 --> 00:02:43,629
He couldn't even wait

52
00:02:43,629 --> 00:02:44,949
for the spare phone

53
00:02:45,069 --> 00:02:46,550
before making that video call.

54
00:02:47,469 --> 00:02:48,710
In that case,

55
00:02:48,789 --> 00:02:49,710
Lu Hui most likely

56
00:02:49,749 --> 00:02:50,629
knows something.

57
00:02:51,590 --> 00:02:53,189
Or she's helping Di Liren

58
00:02:53,349 --> 00:02:54,110
cover something up.

59
00:02:55,349 --> 00:02:56,390
Was she recommended

60
00:02:56,430 --> 00:02:57,349
by Di Liren back then?

61
00:02:57,949 --> 00:02:59,629
No, an agency recommended her.

62
00:03:00,110 --> 00:03:01,749
Ms. Hui used to be a nurse,

63
00:03:02,349 --> 00:03:02,749
good at

64
00:03:02,749 --> 00:03:04,083
caring for Parkinson's patients.

65
00:03:04,949 --> 00:03:05,469
My parents

66
00:03:05,550 --> 00:03:06,550
hired her

67
00:03:06,590 --> 00:03:07,669
once they saw her resume.

68
00:03:08,469 --> 00:03:09,229
Indeed.

69
00:03:09,469 --> 00:03:10,509
Over the past year,

70
00:03:10,909 --> 00:03:12,349
she took great care of them,

71
00:03:12,710 --> 00:03:14,189
and they trust her completely.

72
00:03:14,469 --> 00:03:15,509
Then finding an excuse

73
00:03:15,590 --> 00:03:16,710
to let her go

74
00:03:16,749 --> 00:03:18,229
won't be that easy.

75
00:03:19,909 --> 00:03:20,830
Wait.

76
00:03:21,229 --> 00:03:22,150
You told me

77
00:03:22,270 --> 00:03:23,509
Di Liren's parents died early.

78
00:03:23,590 --> 00:03:24,229
At his hometown,

79
00:03:24,310 --> 00:03:25,430
he might have no relatives.

80
00:03:25,710 --> 00:03:26,870
Maybe

81
00:03:27,189 --> 00:03:27,830
a distant one?

82
00:03:30,030 --> 00:03:30,789
If she isn't

83
00:03:30,789 --> 00:03:31,509
any acquaintance,

84
00:03:31,509 --> 00:03:32,229
I can't figure out

85
00:03:32,509 --> 00:03:33,349
why she would

86
00:03:33,430 --> 00:03:34,430
help Di Liren.

87
00:03:35,590 --> 00:03:36,189
Got paid off?

88
00:03:36,990 --> 00:03:37,590
No way.

89
00:03:37,870 --> 00:03:38,710
Ms. Hui doesn't look

90
00:03:39,229 --> 00:03:40,229
like that kind of person.

91
00:03:41,069 --> 00:03:42,789
What if she's not helping Di Liren,

92
00:03:43,590 --> 00:03:44,830
but that woman?

93
00:03:46,229 --> 00:03:47,270
You mean,

94
00:03:48,629 --> 00:03:49,430
Ms. Hui might

95
00:03:49,430 --> 00:03:50,310
know the mistress?

96
00:03:50,349 --> 00:03:51,629
That photo was mailed

97
00:03:51,669 --> 00:03:52,430
from your address.

98
00:03:52,949 --> 00:03:53,789
Maybe the mistress

99
00:03:53,830 --> 00:03:54,629
had Ms. Hui mail it

100
00:03:54,669 --> 00:03:55,830
to hide her identity.

101
00:03:56,110 --> 00:03:57,189
I bet Di Liren

102
00:03:57,270 --> 00:03:58,270
wouldn't let his mistress

103
00:03:58,270 --> 00:03:59,590
live in your complex.

104
00:03:59,870 --> 00:04:01,110
Liu Bai tailed Di Liren

105
00:04:01,310 --> 00:04:02,550
to your parents' place.

106
00:04:02,710 --> 00:04:03,909
We couldn't figure out why,

107
00:04:04,189 --> 00:04:05,509
but now it all makes sense.

108
00:04:06,229 --> 00:04:07,310
Lu Hui is the go-between

109
00:04:07,430 --> 00:04:08,949
for Di Liren and his mistress.

110
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:10,310
His phone's broken.

111
00:04:10,669 --> 00:04:11,550
The mistress couldn't reach him.

112
00:04:11,550 --> 00:04:12,270
At that moment,

113
00:04:12,710 --> 00:04:13,629
Ms. Hui showed up.

114
00:04:13,710 --> 00:04:14,710
He used her phone

115
00:04:14,789 --> 00:04:16,229
to call the mistress.

116
00:04:30,748 --> 00:04:32,543
(Blood Pressure)

117
00:04:40,950 --> 00:04:41,549
How is it?

118
00:04:41,766 --> 00:04:43,466
(Blood Pressure)

119
00:04:44,150 --> 00:04:44,830
It's normal.

120
00:04:51,469 --> 00:04:52,510
Looking good. See?

121
00:04:54,869 --> 00:04:55,510
Not bad.

122
00:04:55,669 --> 00:04:56,270
Dad.

123
00:04:58,549 --> 00:04:59,229
Meng.

124
00:05:00,630 --> 00:05:01,270
Hui is

125
00:05:02,109 --> 00:05:03,309
so thoughtful.

126
00:05:03,830 --> 00:05:05,510
She checks my blood pressure frequently

127
00:05:05,830 --> 00:05:06,750
and logs every reading

128
00:05:06,789 --> 00:05:07,549
meticulously.

129
00:05:08,429 --> 00:05:09,109
At the hospital,

130
00:05:09,270 --> 00:05:10,150
she knows the answer

131
00:05:10,190 --> 00:05:11,469
to every doctor's question.

132
00:05:11,710 --> 00:05:13,030
Even the doctor praises her.

133
00:05:13,590 --> 00:05:14,549
Thank you, Ms. Hui.

134
00:05:15,150 --> 00:05:15,869
Don't mention it.

135
00:05:17,549 --> 00:05:18,349
Hui even installed

136
00:05:18,510 --> 00:05:19,429
an alarm for me

137
00:05:19,510 --> 00:05:20,229
in the bathroom.

138
00:05:20,390 --> 00:05:21,246
It rings once pulled.

139
00:05:22,070 --> 00:05:23,270
I used to work in a hospital.

140
00:05:23,549 --> 00:05:24,989
I often saw seniors slip and fall

141
00:05:24,989 --> 00:05:25,669
without anyone

142
00:05:25,669 --> 00:05:26,669
noticing immediately.

143
00:05:26,950 --> 00:05:28,510
So I try to be extra careful.

144
00:05:29,869 --> 00:05:30,469
Meng,

145
00:05:30,710 --> 00:05:32,190
is Liren coming for dinner tonight?

146
00:05:33,469 --> 00:05:34,789
He'd come straight from work.

147
00:05:35,789 --> 00:05:36,309
Great.

148
00:05:36,549 --> 00:05:36,950
Well,

149
00:05:37,070 --> 00:05:38,150
I'll let you two talk.

150
00:05:40,070 --> 00:05:40,549
Meng,

151
00:05:41,070 --> 00:05:41,710
you overpaid

152
00:05:41,750 --> 00:05:42,669
my salary last month.

153
00:05:43,989 --> 00:05:44,909
Not at all.

154
00:05:45,469 --> 00:05:45,989
Ms. Hui,

155
00:05:46,190 --> 00:05:47,669
you take such great care of them.

156
00:05:47,989 --> 00:05:49,109
That's a bonus.

157
00:05:49,229 --> 00:05:49,950
Just keep it.

158
00:05:50,109 --> 00:05:51,429
I only take my salary.

159
00:05:51,630 --> 00:05:52,270
Can't take it.

160
00:05:52,590 --> 00:05:53,270
I'll refund you.

161
00:05:53,950 --> 00:05:55,590
It's fine. Just keep it.

162
00:05:56,549 --> 00:05:57,229
Besides,

163
00:05:57,830 --> 00:05:59,270
that's from my own pocket.

164
00:05:59,630 --> 00:06:00,429
He won't know.

165
00:06:00,750 --> 00:06:01,349
Take it.

166
00:06:01,869 --> 00:06:02,830
Thank you,

167
00:06:03,750 --> 00:06:04,510
but

168
00:06:05,950 --> 00:06:07,030
I only take my salary.

169
00:06:07,950 --> 00:06:09,229
I can't accept any extra.

170
00:06:09,710 --> 00:06:10,669
Come on.

171
00:06:10,789 --> 00:06:12,030
Just take it.

172
00:06:12,549 --> 00:06:13,150
Well, Ms. Hui,

173
00:06:13,669 --> 00:06:14,909
I want to ask you something.

174
00:06:15,510 --> 00:06:17,390
Do you have any former colleagues

175
00:06:17,549 --> 00:06:18,750
who do caregiving?

176
00:06:19,229 --> 00:06:20,349
My friend is looking for

177
00:06:20,590 --> 00:06:21,429
a reliable caregiver

178
00:06:21,469 --> 00:06:22,510
like you.

179
00:06:23,909 --> 00:06:24,710
I'll ask around.

180
00:06:25,909 --> 00:06:26,989
Which hospital

181
00:06:27,510 --> 00:06:28,590
did you work at before?

182
00:06:29,229 --> 00:06:30,309
Xiaocheng First Hospital.

183
00:06:31,030 --> 00:06:31,950
Xiaocheng?

184
00:06:32,549 --> 00:06:33,789
I've been there.

185
00:06:34,109 --> 00:06:34,830
It's a nice place.

186
00:06:35,909 --> 00:06:37,030
Why did you come

187
00:06:37,150 --> 00:06:38,309
to work here?

188
00:06:39,630 --> 00:06:40,789
After my father passed away,

189
00:06:41,309 --> 00:06:42,109
I got divorced.

190
00:06:42,390 --> 00:06:43,750
There's nothing keeping me there.

191
00:06:45,710 --> 00:06:46,869
Divorced?

192
00:06:48,270 --> 00:06:49,669
What does your ex-husband do?

193
00:06:53,349 --> 00:06:54,030
Meng,

194
00:06:54,590 --> 00:06:55,789
what's wrong with you?

195
00:06:55,789 --> 00:06:56,590
Why keep bringing up

196
00:06:56,590 --> 00:06:58,070
Ms. Hui's painful memories?

197
00:06:58,750 --> 00:06:59,789
She lost touch with her ex

198
00:06:59,789 --> 00:07:00,869
a long time ago.

199
00:07:01,349 --> 00:07:02,390
She doesn't know

200
00:07:02,390 --> 00:07:03,309
what he does,

201
00:07:03,390 --> 00:07:04,270
or if he remarried.

202
00:07:04,750 --> 00:07:06,229
I just wanted to know more about her.

203
00:07:06,950 --> 00:07:07,510
But, Dad,

204
00:07:07,989 --> 00:07:09,309
how do you know so much?

205
00:07:10,669 --> 00:07:11,909
I only heard bits and pieces

206
00:07:11,909 --> 00:07:13,349
from Hui.

207
00:07:14,710 --> 00:07:15,590
Just the other day,

208
00:07:15,630 --> 00:07:17,190
her daughter

209
00:07:17,190 --> 00:07:18,469
called her up

210
00:07:18,789 --> 00:07:19,750
asking for money.

211
00:07:20,789 --> 00:07:22,469
She wants to study abroad

212
00:07:22,549 --> 00:07:23,789
and travel the world.

213
00:07:24,950 --> 00:07:25,510
Hui told her

214
00:07:25,510 --> 00:07:26,549
to ask her dad.

215
00:07:27,070 --> 00:07:27,549
But still,

216
00:07:28,150 --> 00:07:29,309
she gave her daughter

217
00:07:29,429 --> 00:07:30,270
money.

218
00:07:31,229 --> 00:07:32,669
Where did she get that money?

219
00:07:33,789 --> 00:07:34,510
Exactly.

220
00:07:35,309 --> 00:07:36,070
You kids don't get

221
00:07:36,469 --> 00:07:38,469
how tough life can be.

222
00:07:39,190 --> 00:07:40,429
Hui is having a tough life.

223
00:07:40,710 --> 00:07:41,630
We should try our best

224
00:07:41,789 --> 00:07:42,830
to help her.

225
00:07:44,869 --> 00:07:46,229
She really has it tough.

226
00:07:48,469 --> 00:07:49,630
Because of the divorce,

227
00:07:49,669 --> 00:07:51,469
her daughter

228
00:07:52,630 --> 00:07:53,630
resents her

229
00:07:53,710 --> 00:07:54,549
quite a bit.

230
00:07:55,590 --> 00:07:56,750
She never reaches out,

231
00:07:56,869 --> 00:07:57,590
only calls

232
00:07:57,630 --> 00:07:58,630
when she needs cash.

233
00:07:59,989 --> 00:08:01,229
Hui has been upset

234
00:08:01,630 --> 00:08:02,630
about it.

235
00:08:03,229 --> 00:08:03,869
One day,

236
00:08:04,190 --> 00:08:05,669
I even saw her

237
00:08:05,669 --> 00:08:07,390
crying alone in her room.

238
00:08:08,309 --> 00:08:09,109
Which day?

239
00:08:09,190 --> 00:08:09,710
It was...

240
00:08:17,390 --> 00:08:18,030
By the way, Mom,

241
00:08:18,429 --> 00:08:19,750
back then,

242
00:08:19,909 --> 00:08:20,830
the agency recommended

243
00:08:20,830 --> 00:08:21,669
a lot of candidates.

244
00:08:21,950 --> 00:08:22,630
How did we end up

245
00:08:22,630 --> 00:08:23,830
choosing Ms. Hui?

246
00:08:23,989 --> 00:08:25,190
Liu Zi wants

247
00:08:25,190 --> 00:08:25,909
to get a caregiver

248
00:08:25,909 --> 00:08:26,590
for her mom,

249
00:08:26,989 --> 00:08:28,160
and asks me how to pick one.

250
00:08:28,549 --> 00:08:30,270
Character comes first,

251
00:08:30,510 --> 00:08:32,390
then skills.

252
00:08:33,110 --> 00:08:34,589
Ms. Liu's caregiver

253
00:08:34,789 --> 00:08:36,069
has a gambler husband.

254
00:08:36,350 --> 00:08:37,789
He stole things from them

255
00:08:37,789 --> 00:08:39,030
and sold them.

256
00:08:39,069 --> 00:08:40,150
Horrible, right?

257
00:08:41,110 --> 00:08:41,750
Hui's background

258
00:08:41,829 --> 00:08:42,990
is very simple.

259
00:08:43,589 --> 00:08:44,669
Her parents are gone,

260
00:08:45,069 --> 00:08:46,309
and her kid lives with the ex.

261
00:08:47,309 --> 00:08:48,789
She doesn't need

262
00:08:48,789 --> 00:08:49,789
holidays off.

263
00:08:50,110 --> 00:08:50,630
How nice.

264
00:08:50,709 --> 00:08:51,270
Right.

265
00:08:52,630 --> 00:08:53,309
So you are

266
00:08:53,309 --> 00:08:54,429
an exploitative boss.

267
00:08:54,750 --> 00:08:56,309
Your husband said it.

268
00:08:56,350 --> 00:08:57,270
Go ask him.

269
00:08:58,390 --> 00:09:00,150
He was the one who picked Hui.

270
00:09:02,309 --> 00:09:02,949
So,

271
00:09:03,429 --> 00:09:04,870
it was Di Liren who picked Ms. Hui.

272
00:09:06,949 --> 00:09:07,390
Ms. Hui,

273
00:09:07,589 --> 00:09:08,030
two more.

274
00:09:08,030 --> 00:09:08,390
Okay.

275
00:09:10,030 --> 00:09:10,630
Honey,

276
00:09:11,669 --> 00:09:12,470
your delivery!

277
00:09:14,630 --> 00:09:15,462
I'll put them here.

278
00:09:15,829 --> 00:09:16,230
Okay.

279
00:09:19,429 --> 00:09:20,429
That was fast.

280
00:09:20,750 --> 00:09:21,949
It's the clothes I bought.

281
00:09:22,829 --> 00:09:23,270
Meng,

282
00:09:24,110 --> 00:09:25,069
why don't you

283
00:09:25,069 --> 00:09:26,270
ship your clothes

284
00:09:26,350 --> 00:09:27,270
to your own place?

285
00:09:27,510 --> 00:09:28,709
Because these

286
00:09:28,709 --> 00:09:29,949
are all clothes

287
00:09:29,949 --> 00:09:30,990
I bought for Ms. Hui.

288
00:09:32,429 --> 00:09:33,030
Ms. Hui,

289
00:09:33,549 --> 00:09:34,870
your clothes are all

290
00:09:35,110 --> 00:09:35,909
worn out.

291
00:09:35,909 --> 00:09:37,270
Just throw them away.

292
00:09:37,909 --> 00:09:38,829
Wear these instead.

293
00:09:40,110 --> 00:09:40,750
I picked these

294
00:09:41,709 --> 00:09:43,110
specifically for you.

295
00:09:43,309 --> 00:09:43,870
Take a look

296
00:09:43,870 --> 00:09:45,230
and see if the sizes

297
00:09:45,230 --> 00:09:45,870
fit.

298
00:09:46,829 --> 00:09:47,350
Meng,

299
00:09:47,750 --> 00:09:48,390
thank you.

300
00:09:48,909 --> 00:09:49,709
But I have nowhere

301
00:09:49,829 --> 00:09:50,789
to wear these clothes.

302
00:09:51,829 --> 00:09:52,429
Really.

303
00:09:53,270 --> 00:09:54,630
Of course, you do.

304
00:09:54,669 --> 00:09:56,110
You can wear them on your days off.

305
00:09:56,630 --> 00:09:57,230
Don't you ever

306
00:09:57,230 --> 00:09:58,309
go out on your days off?

307
00:09:58,909 --> 00:10:00,350
I don't.

308
00:10:00,470 --> 00:10:01,030
Thanks anyway.

309
00:10:01,949 --> 00:10:02,549
Well,

310
00:10:03,110 --> 00:10:04,589
don't you have any friends here?

311
00:10:07,110 --> 00:10:07,630
No.

312
00:10:10,189 --> 00:10:11,110
What about relatives?

313
00:10:14,350 --> 00:10:14,949
None either.

314
00:10:18,150 --> 00:10:18,470
Meng,

315
00:10:18,630 --> 00:10:19,630
please return them.

316
00:10:20,470 --> 00:10:21,390
I don't need them.

317
00:10:21,549 --> 00:10:22,030
Thank you.

318
00:10:30,110 --> 00:10:30,829
With the tags off,

319
00:10:30,829 --> 00:10:32,069
they can't be returned now.

320
00:10:32,549 --> 00:10:33,870
Just keep them, Ms. Hui.

321
00:10:34,030 --> 00:10:34,789
I spent a long time

322
00:10:34,789 --> 00:10:35,870
picking them out for you.

323
00:10:35,870 --> 00:10:36,669
I really...

324
00:10:37,150 --> 00:10:37,709
Ms. Hui,

325
00:10:38,709 --> 00:10:39,630
Meng just meant well.

326
00:10:40,230 --> 00:10:40,709
Take them.

327
00:10:43,270 --> 00:10:43,709
Well,

328
00:10:45,350 --> 00:10:46,230
thank you, Meng.

329
00:10:49,150 --> 00:10:49,909
Well, well.

330
00:10:50,990 --> 00:10:52,870
Ms. Hui refused to take them from me,

331
00:10:53,390 --> 00:10:54,429
but she accepted

332
00:10:54,709 --> 00:10:55,870
once my husband chimed in.

333
00:10:57,709 --> 00:10:58,949
It seems that in this house,

334
00:10:59,390 --> 00:11:00,909
Liren has the final word.

335
00:11:05,150 --> 00:11:05,750
Did Ms. Hui

336
00:11:05,750 --> 00:11:06,949
look upset just now?

337
00:11:07,510 --> 00:11:08,669
If you hadn't reminded me,

338
00:11:09,230 --> 00:11:10,230
I wouldn't have noticed.

339
00:11:11,789 --> 00:11:12,750
Why would she be?

340
00:11:13,030 --> 00:11:13,990
You just meant well.

341
00:11:16,789 --> 00:11:17,510
But Honey,

342
00:11:18,350 --> 00:11:19,909
her reaction felt

343
00:11:20,309 --> 00:11:21,270
a bit strange.

344
00:11:23,110 --> 00:11:24,909
Maybe she's having an off day.

345
00:11:25,230 --> 00:11:26,189
Everyone has sore spots.

346
00:11:27,030 --> 00:11:28,350
Her ex got custody of her kid.

347
00:11:28,789 --> 00:11:30,150
We should avoid asking about it.

348
00:11:32,750 --> 00:11:33,110
Right.

349
00:11:33,630 --> 00:11:34,589
Which country

350
00:11:34,789 --> 00:11:35,949
is her daughter studying in?

351
00:11:37,589 --> 00:11:38,309
No idea.

352
00:11:39,470 --> 00:11:40,390
Since she doesn't talk,

353
00:11:40,789 --> 00:11:41,909
it's probably too painful.

354
00:11:43,270 --> 00:11:44,549
Have you never met her daughter?

355
00:11:45,709 --> 00:11:47,230
Why would I have met her?

356
00:11:47,870 --> 00:11:48,309
Well,

357
00:11:48,870 --> 00:11:49,789
aren't you and Ms. Hui

358
00:11:50,230 --> 00:11:51,390
both from Xiaocheng?

359
00:11:51,990 --> 00:11:53,110
Didn't you two meet before?

360
00:11:54,470 --> 00:11:55,510
Xiaocheng is huge.

361
00:11:55,750 --> 00:11:56,789
How could I meet everyone?

362
00:12:01,709 --> 00:12:02,270
No.

363
00:12:04,990 --> 00:12:05,949
You must be hiding

364
00:12:05,949 --> 00:12:06,510
something.

365
00:12:07,829 --> 00:12:08,630
What's wrong?

366
00:12:11,189 --> 00:12:11,990
What is this?

367
00:12:13,949 --> 00:12:14,589
Honey,

368
00:12:14,589 --> 00:12:15,669
you must know some gossip

369
00:12:15,669 --> 00:12:16,669
and just don't tell me,

370
00:12:16,669 --> 00:12:17,510
right?

371
00:12:17,750 --> 00:12:18,870
Come on, tell me.

372
00:12:20,909 --> 00:12:22,230
I really don't.

373
00:12:23,189 --> 00:12:24,589
I don't chat with her.

374
00:12:25,069 --> 00:12:26,429
Dad knows way more than I do.

375
00:12:27,870 --> 00:12:28,429
You liar.

376
00:12:31,189 --> 00:12:31,990
Wait for me.

377
00:12:37,862 --> 00:12:39,070
(Calcium)

378
00:12:41,470 --> 00:12:42,309
Mom, Dad.

379
00:12:43,750 --> 00:12:44,589
Meng.

380
00:12:44,589 --> 00:12:45,429
You are back.

381
00:12:46,150 --> 00:12:47,069
What's all this?

382
00:12:47,150 --> 00:12:48,069
Why so much stuff?

383
00:12:48,350 --> 00:12:49,030
Hui bought

384
00:12:49,390 --> 00:12:50,309
calcium pills

385
00:12:50,309 --> 00:12:51,350
for your dad

386
00:12:51,470 --> 00:12:52,870
and herbal tonic gelatin for me.

387
00:12:53,350 --> 00:12:54,709
It must have cost a pretty penny.

388
00:12:56,390 --> 00:12:58,549
She said it was from your bonus.

389
00:12:59,030 --> 00:13:00,270
She had nothing to buy,

390
00:13:00,549 --> 00:13:01,909
so she got all these for us.

391
00:13:02,309 --> 00:13:03,390
Is that true?

392
00:13:04,150 --> 00:13:05,630
Ms. Hui takes great care of you,

393
00:13:06,150 --> 00:13:06,909
so she deserves

394
00:13:06,909 --> 00:13:07,949
that bonus.

395
00:13:12,309 --> 00:13:13,230
I thought

396
00:13:13,230 --> 00:13:14,350
it's the same calcium pills

397
00:13:14,429 --> 00:13:15,510
I got you, right?

398
00:13:15,870 --> 00:13:16,870
That's calcium carbonate.

399
00:13:17,429 --> 00:13:18,390
That would cause seniors

400
00:13:18,429 --> 00:13:19,870
discomfort and bloating.

401
00:13:20,230 --> 00:13:21,429
Mine's the calcium citrate.

402
00:13:22,110 --> 00:13:22,750
Easily absorbed.

403
00:13:22,870 --> 00:13:23,709
It suits seniors.

404
00:13:24,750 --> 00:13:25,789
I checked with a doctor.

405
00:13:25,949 --> 00:13:27,110
Your parents can take it.

406
00:13:29,949 --> 00:13:30,350
Lizhen,

407
00:13:30,909 --> 00:13:31,270
look.

408
00:13:31,630 --> 00:13:32,589
Meng is jealous.

409
00:13:33,510 --> 00:13:34,110
Meng,

410
00:13:34,589 --> 00:13:35,709
Hui

411
00:13:35,909 --> 00:13:36,909
was a nurse.

412
00:13:37,150 --> 00:13:38,110
She's professional.

413
00:13:43,589 --> 00:13:44,230
What's up, Dad?

414
00:13:44,350 --> 00:13:45,270
I'm fine.

415
00:13:45,589 --> 00:13:46,390
The doctor said

416
00:13:47,110 --> 00:13:48,510
it's nothing serious. No worries.

417
00:13:48,510 --> 00:13:49,189
Just sit.

418
00:13:51,350 --> 00:13:52,230
The doctor taught me

419
00:13:52,270 --> 00:13:53,069
these techniques.

420
00:13:53,630 --> 00:13:54,709
Whenever Mr. Yu feels off,

421
00:13:54,750 --> 00:13:55,350
massage

422
00:13:55,510 --> 00:13:56,150
can be helpful.

423
00:13:59,990 --> 00:14:00,829
Thank you, Ms. Hui.

424
00:14:00,949 --> 00:14:01,589
Really.

425
00:14:02,709 --> 00:14:03,150
Ms. Hui,

426
00:14:03,669 --> 00:14:04,429
how much

427
00:14:04,510 --> 00:14:05,309
are the supplements?

428
00:14:05,630 --> 00:14:06,408
I'll give you back.

429
00:14:06,549 --> 00:14:07,350
That bonus couldn't

430
00:14:07,470 --> 00:14:08,230
cover all this.

431
00:14:08,669 --> 00:14:09,030
No need.

432
00:14:09,549 --> 00:14:10,510
I have nothing to buy.

433
00:14:11,270 --> 00:14:12,230
You stay for dinner?

434
00:14:12,350 --> 00:14:12,949
I'll make more.

435
00:14:14,949 --> 00:14:15,870
No.

436
00:14:16,510 --> 00:14:16,909
I came

437
00:14:16,909 --> 00:14:17,990
to tell you

438
00:14:17,990 --> 00:14:19,150
I have a video shoot with Zi.

439
00:14:19,150 --> 00:14:20,350
I'll only be back tomorrow.

440
00:14:20,709 --> 00:14:22,270
Don't just vanish again.

441
00:14:22,549 --> 00:14:23,390
Take your phone.

442
00:14:23,870 --> 00:14:25,270
Don't worry, Mom.

443
00:14:25,309 --> 00:14:26,110
You can call Zi

444
00:14:26,110 --> 00:14:26,909
to reach me as well.

445
00:14:27,189 --> 00:14:27,589
Meng,

446
00:14:27,789 --> 00:14:28,949
have Liren drive you.

447
00:14:29,669 --> 00:14:30,990
No need, Dad. He's busy.

448
00:14:31,270 --> 00:14:32,110
I can go myself.

449
00:14:33,870 --> 00:14:34,589
We drove

450
00:14:34,630 --> 00:14:35,549
all the way out here.

451
00:14:35,630 --> 00:14:36,589
What are we shooting?

452
00:14:37,909 --> 00:14:38,589
Nothing.

453
00:14:39,270 --> 00:14:39,909
Nothing?

454
00:14:41,030 --> 00:14:42,309
I brought you here

455
00:14:42,390 --> 00:14:43,709
just to tell Di Liren

456
00:14:43,709 --> 00:14:44,230
and Lu Hui

457
00:14:44,510 --> 00:14:45,470
that I'd be away today.

458
00:14:45,709 --> 00:14:46,150
Why?

459
00:14:46,270 --> 00:14:47,549
You think they'll make a move?

460
00:14:48,750 --> 00:14:49,990
I deliberately asked Lu Hui

461
00:14:49,990 --> 00:14:50,669
many questions.

462
00:14:51,230 --> 00:14:52,390
And they seemed rattled.

463
00:14:52,870 --> 00:14:53,709
Now,

464
00:14:53,909 --> 00:14:55,150
they won't stay idle.

465
00:14:55,829 --> 00:14:57,309
Sounds like you have a plan.

466
00:15:00,110 --> 00:15:01,189
Thinking back carefully,

467
00:15:01,870 --> 00:15:03,390
whenever Di Liren is home,

468
00:15:03,669 --> 00:15:04,750
he never chats

469
00:15:04,789 --> 00:15:05,709
with Lu Hui,

470
00:15:06,470 --> 00:15:07,390
except in two places.

471
00:15:08,189 --> 00:15:08,789
Where?

472
00:15:09,350 --> 00:15:10,150
The terrace,

473
00:15:10,309 --> 00:15:11,309
and the courtyard.

474
00:15:12,789 --> 00:15:13,230
Lizhen,

475
00:15:14,949 --> 00:15:16,429
the air feels so good out here.

476
00:15:16,909 --> 00:15:17,309
Here.

477
00:15:19,069 --> 00:15:19,589
Refreshing.

478
00:15:27,309 --> 00:15:28,309
Have some fruit.

479
00:15:29,669 --> 00:15:30,150
Hui,

480
00:15:30,750 --> 00:15:32,589
what year is your daughter in college?

481
00:15:34,030 --> 00:15:34,630
Graduate soon.

482
00:15:35,069 --> 00:15:36,150
Does she have a boyfriend?

483
00:15:39,589 --> 00:15:39,990
No.

484
00:15:41,669 --> 00:15:42,069
Good.

485
00:15:42,909 --> 00:15:43,990
A young girl

486
00:15:45,110 --> 00:15:46,589
should focus on her studies.

487
00:15:47,230 --> 00:15:47,870
So,

488
00:15:47,909 --> 00:15:48,630
is she planning

489
00:15:48,630 --> 00:15:49,789
to go to graduate school?

490
00:15:50,669 --> 00:15:51,669
She hasn't told me,

491
00:15:51,669 --> 00:15:52,990
so I'm not sure.

492
00:15:53,990 --> 00:15:54,789
That won't do.

493
00:15:56,110 --> 00:15:56,750
I think

494
00:15:56,909 --> 00:15:57,870
a parent should step in

495
00:15:58,110 --> 00:15:59,270
when needed.

496
00:15:59,709 --> 00:16:01,870
She's still young and ignorant.

497
00:16:01,990 --> 00:16:03,150
She studies abroad.

498
00:16:03,150 --> 00:16:04,150
She's seen the world.

499
00:16:04,390 --> 00:16:05,390
She knows plenty.

500
00:16:07,350 --> 00:16:08,309
I mean,

501
00:16:08,429 --> 00:16:09,630
like with our Meng.

502
00:16:09,789 --> 00:16:10,150
Remember?

503
00:16:10,350 --> 00:16:11,429
When she finished college,

504
00:16:11,589 --> 00:16:13,069
we wanted her to go to grad school.

505
00:16:13,189 --> 00:16:14,789
We even picked the school for her,

506
00:16:14,909 --> 00:16:15,309
and yet

507
00:16:15,549 --> 00:16:17,069
she refused to go.

508
00:16:31,949 --> 00:16:32,589
It's pitch dark.

509
00:16:33,069 --> 00:16:34,030
Why still out here?

510
00:16:34,589 --> 00:16:35,870
Just catching my breath, Mr. Di.

511
00:16:38,470 --> 00:16:38,909
I'll help.

512
00:16:39,669 --> 00:16:40,069
No need.

513
00:16:52,829 --> 00:16:54,150
You handled the money

514
00:16:54,630 --> 00:16:55,829
Yu Meng gave you well.

515
00:16:56,669 --> 00:16:57,589
What else could I do?

516
00:16:58,669 --> 00:16:59,350
Yu Meng has been

517
00:16:59,350 --> 00:17:00,270
asking about you.

518
00:17:01,069 --> 00:17:01,750
I'm worried.

519
00:17:02,829 --> 00:17:03,949
I have an idea.

520
00:17:04,430 --> 00:17:05,589
You set things up these days.

521
00:17:07,149 --> 00:17:08,470
Just say your child is sick,

522
00:17:08,789 --> 00:17:09,710
and in two weeks,

523
00:17:10,109 --> 00:17:11,389
you have to go abroad with her

524
00:17:11,549 --> 00:17:12,109
for surgery.

525
00:17:15,869 --> 00:17:16,470
Why?

526
00:17:16,990 --> 00:17:17,710
Yu Meng might be

527
00:17:17,710 --> 00:17:18,829
suspicious of you.

528
00:17:19,470 --> 00:17:20,829
You're working here.

529
00:17:21,430 --> 00:17:22,109
If things go off,

530
00:17:22,309 --> 00:17:23,589
it's three against one.

531
00:17:23,789 --> 00:17:24,670
You might get hurt.

532
00:17:25,910 --> 00:17:26,789
You are here, right?

533
00:17:28,470 --> 00:17:29,470
What if I'm not around?

534
00:17:29,710 --> 00:17:30,309
I won't leave

535
00:17:31,389 --> 00:17:32,030
until you do.

536
00:17:33,789 --> 00:17:34,190
Lu Hui.

537
00:17:52,149 --> 00:17:53,670
I felt the calluses on your hands,

538
00:17:54,710 --> 00:17:55,589
and I never forgot.

539
00:17:58,470 --> 00:17:59,309
I asked

540
00:17:59,309 --> 00:18:00,309
our R&D team,

541
00:18:00,869 --> 00:18:02,430
and they told me almond oil

542
00:18:02,869 --> 00:18:03,589
and fruit acids

543
00:18:04,069 --> 00:18:04,825
in this hand cream

544
00:18:05,789 --> 00:18:06,750
can soften calluses.

545
00:18:08,670 --> 00:18:09,750
So I bought some.

546
00:18:10,389 --> 00:18:11,190
In your room now.

547
00:18:11,990 --> 00:18:12,510
Use them.

548
00:18:15,789 --> 00:18:16,629
I'm just a caregiver.

549
00:18:18,030 --> 00:18:19,789
Calluses are only natural.

550
00:18:23,510 --> 00:18:24,230
To me,

551
00:18:25,190 --> 00:18:26,629
you're still the same as before.

552
00:18:28,030 --> 00:18:28,789
Like what?

553
00:18:29,829 --> 00:18:30,589
The one I want

554
00:18:30,589 --> 00:18:31,470
to take care.

555
00:18:32,002 --> 00:18:36,149
(Xiaocheng, 21 Years Ago)

556
00:18:36,149 --> 00:18:37,283
(Young Di Liren)
The funeral is starting soon.

557
00:18:38,076 --> 00:18:39,696
(Young Lu Hui)

558
00:18:43,149 --> 00:18:44,230
In a few days,

559
00:18:44,789 --> 00:18:46,030
the factory will shut down.

560
00:18:49,149 --> 00:18:49,789
With Dad gone,

561
00:18:54,149 --> 00:18:54,750
I have nowhere

562
00:18:54,789 --> 00:18:55,869
left to go.

563
00:19:04,270 --> 00:19:04,910
Stay with me.

564
00:19:06,589 --> 00:19:07,270
From now on,

565
00:19:08,190 --> 00:19:09,110
I'll take care of you.

566
00:19:11,190 --> 00:19:11,710
No.

567
00:19:15,430 --> 00:19:16,750
I can't become a burden to you.

568
00:19:23,149 --> 00:19:24,230
Have you ever considered

569
00:19:25,589 --> 00:19:26,349
what will happen

570
00:19:26,349 --> 00:19:27,549
if they know about us?

571
00:19:29,750 --> 00:19:30,950
If something happens to you,

572
00:19:32,069 --> 00:19:33,389
what I've done will be in vain.

573
00:19:42,950 --> 00:19:43,950
We have no relationship,

574
00:19:46,109 --> 00:19:47,149
and we shouldn't have one.

575
00:19:48,230 --> 00:19:48,910
I know

576
00:19:49,910 --> 00:19:50,629
you're worried

577
00:19:50,670 --> 00:19:51,829
that I love that woman,

578
00:19:52,230 --> 00:19:52,670
right?

579
00:19:53,309 --> 00:19:54,030
I swear to you,

580
00:19:54,869 --> 00:19:56,309
it's all just an act.

581
00:19:56,750 --> 00:19:57,789
Once I take care

582
00:19:57,829 --> 00:19:58,549
of everything,

583
00:19:59,030 --> 00:19:59,789
we'll leave here.

584
00:20:00,470 --> 00:20:01,389
I'll make up

585
00:20:01,389 --> 00:20:02,670
for all the years we missed.

586
00:20:03,149 --> 00:20:04,069
Just give me some time,

587
00:20:04,869 --> 00:20:05,309
okay?

588
00:20:32,789 --> 00:20:34,309
Turns out my life

589
00:20:34,710 --> 00:20:36,510
is just like making videos.

590
00:20:37,230 --> 00:20:39,470
Partly real, mostly fake.

591
00:20:40,470 --> 00:20:41,190
No one knows

592
00:20:41,190 --> 00:20:42,430
that a marriage looking perfect

593
00:20:42,789 --> 00:20:44,430
from the outside

594
00:20:44,950 --> 00:20:46,069
could be completely

595
00:20:46,069 --> 00:20:47,549
(Good morning, Honey)
rotten to the core.

596
00:20:48,389 --> 00:20:49,470
And inside me,

597
00:20:50,389 --> 00:20:51,910
(I'm heading to work)
countless insects are eating away

598
00:20:51,910 --> 00:20:52,670
(Left you breakfast in the kitchen)
at my flesh.

599
00:20:52,950 --> 00:20:54,069
(Wait for me to get back)
I can clearly hear

