(Zhang Tao)

897
00:31:15,270 --> 00:31:15,910
(Found it.)

898
00:31:16,069 --> 00:31:17,789
(Mrs. Di frequents a law firm recently.)

899
00:31:18,030 --> 00:31:19,030
(It's called)

900
00:31:19,030 --> 00:31:20,470
(Yihe Firm.)

901
00:31:26,470 --> 00:31:27,270
What is it?

902
00:31:28,309 --> 00:31:29,149
A resignation letter.

903
00:31:29,149 --> 00:31:29,829
Ready to send.

904
00:31:30,829 --> 00:31:31,910
Just send it to Yu Meng.

905
00:31:32,510 --> 00:31:33,069
I won't.

906
00:31:34,710 --> 00:31:35,710
I won't leave on my own

907
00:31:36,430 --> 00:31:37,510
and leave you here.

908
00:31:38,149 --> 00:31:38,750
Yu Meng's been

909
00:31:38,829 --> 00:31:39,789
watching you lately.

910
00:31:40,389 --> 00:31:41,629
She asked about your past,

911
00:31:42,109 --> 00:31:43,349
gave you a bonus,

912
00:31:43,710 --> 00:31:44,670
checked your posts

913
00:31:44,670 --> 00:31:45,430
last night,

914
00:31:46,230 --> 00:31:46,990
and even asked me

915
00:31:46,990 --> 00:31:48,030
about your family.

916
00:31:48,869 --> 00:31:49,829
Isn't that great?

917
00:31:50,990 --> 00:31:51,629
You know best

918
00:31:51,670 --> 00:31:52,589
what to say.

919
00:31:52,589 --> 00:31:54,149
We are in danger now.

920
00:31:54,789 --> 00:31:56,149
I don't know what and how much

921
00:31:56,389 --> 00:31:57,149
Yu Meng knows.

922
00:31:58,030 --> 00:32:00,109
If she finds out the truth, we're dead.

923
00:32:00,309 --> 00:32:00,829
She won't.

924
00:32:01,869 --> 00:32:03,109
If that day really comes,

925
00:32:04,270 --> 00:32:05,270
I'll go down with you.

926
00:32:08,589 --> 00:32:09,549
Give me some time.

927
00:32:09,750 --> 00:32:10,270
I've heard it

928
00:32:10,270 --> 00:32:11,670
so many times.

929
00:32:12,549 --> 00:32:13,549
Anything new?

930
00:32:18,670 --> 00:32:19,069
Fine.

931
00:32:19,910 --> 00:32:20,990
I'll set a deadline.

932
00:32:22,510 --> 00:32:23,127
Three months.

933
00:32:23,430 --> 00:32:23,869
Why?

934
00:32:24,309 --> 00:32:25,829
I have to handle the company's

935
00:32:26,510 --> 00:32:28,030
new product launch.

936
00:32:29,069 --> 00:32:30,230
I don't trust anyone else.

937
00:32:30,670 --> 00:32:31,389
If someone

938
00:32:31,389 --> 00:32:32,629
targets the new product line

939
00:32:33,270 --> 00:32:34,430
and accuses us of embezzling

940
00:32:34,470 --> 00:32:35,230
company assets,

941
00:32:35,829 --> 00:32:36,629
we'll be in trouble.

942
00:32:37,030 --> 00:32:37,950
Embezzling?

943
00:32:39,109 --> 00:32:39,750
Why?

944
00:32:40,750 --> 00:32:41,869
Isn't that all your money?

945
00:32:42,230 --> 00:32:43,149
Of course, yes.

946
00:32:43,629 --> 00:32:44,549
My conscience is clear.

947
00:32:45,309 --> 00:32:45,950
Anyway,

948
00:32:46,109 --> 00:32:47,309
I deserve even more than this.

949
00:32:47,950 --> 00:32:48,789
But that won't stop

950
00:32:48,789 --> 00:32:50,309
others from smearing me.

951
00:32:50,789 --> 00:32:51,599
Like the Yu family.

952
00:32:51,869 --> 00:32:52,950
I've consulted a lawyer.

953
00:32:53,470 --> 00:32:54,349
Worst case,

954
00:32:55,030 --> 00:32:56,230
both of us end up behind bars.

955
00:33:01,389 --> 00:33:02,389
Doctor, hello.

956
00:33:02,589 --> 00:33:02,910
Hello.

957
00:33:03,789 --> 00:33:04,430
For the patient

958
00:33:04,430 --> 00:33:05,549
in Ward 305, Section 1.

959
00:33:06,230 --> 00:33:06,670
What is it?

960
00:33:07,430 --> 00:33:08,030
Well,

961
00:33:08,309 --> 00:33:08,950
my father-in-law

962
00:33:08,990 --> 00:33:10,869
received rescue
for a cerebral hemorrhage.

963
00:33:11,470 --> 00:33:12,950
He's feeling so stressful now,

964
00:33:13,389 --> 00:33:14,549
always sighing and saying

965
00:33:14,829 --> 00:33:15,710
we're lying to him.

966
00:33:16,149 --> 00:33:16,510
He thinks

967
00:33:16,510 --> 00:33:17,750
he won't ever recover.

968
00:33:18,270 --> 00:33:18,750
What

969
00:33:18,750 --> 00:33:19,910
should we do now?

970
00:33:20,149 --> 00:33:21,510
Given his current condition,

971
00:33:21,710 --> 00:33:22,710
if he stays on treatment,

972
00:33:23,190 --> 00:33:23,789
and tries best

973
00:33:23,950 --> 00:33:25,030
to prevent strokes,

974
00:33:25,349 --> 00:33:26,109
he can achieve

975
00:33:26,309 --> 00:33:27,910
positive and significant results.

976
00:33:28,549 --> 00:33:28,950
However,

977
00:33:29,270 --> 00:33:30,030
to prevent strokes,

978
00:33:30,230 --> 00:33:31,829
getting enough sleep

979
00:33:32,149 --> 00:33:33,710
is especially critical.

980
00:33:34,869 --> 00:33:35,309
Got it.

981
00:33:35,629 --> 00:33:36,190
Thank you.

982
00:33:53,629 --> 00:33:54,430
I saved it for you.

983
00:33:55,470 --> 00:33:57,109
Just in case.

984
00:34:02,549 --> 00:34:03,829
This is all the information

985
00:34:03,950 --> 00:34:05,430
I could find on Lu Hui.

986
00:34:12,229 --> 00:34:13,669
You are taking advice, Mr. Jiao.

987
00:34:14,589 --> 00:34:15,390
You got a new chair.

988
00:34:15,870 --> 00:34:17,109
I told you.

989
00:34:17,589 --> 00:34:18,830
You should've listened to me.

990
00:34:19,749 --> 00:34:20,669
This chair

991
00:34:21,269 --> 00:34:22,549
is so much more comfortable.

992
00:34:22,910 --> 00:34:24,549
We happened to have a budget this year.

993
00:34:24,830 --> 00:34:25,549
That's all.

994
00:34:26,589 --> 00:34:27,549
Okay, down to business.

995
00:34:28,149 --> 00:34:29,589
Both Lu Hui and Di Liren

996
00:34:29,990 --> 00:34:30,870
are from Xiaocheng.

997
00:34:31,790 --> 00:34:32,870
What a coincidence.

998
00:34:34,709 --> 00:34:35,790
Mr. Jiao, tell me about

999
00:34:36,350 --> 00:34:36,910
your thought.

1000
00:34:37,589 --> 00:34:39,254
They might have known
each other for long.

1001
00:34:39,470 --> 00:34:40,790
Like relatives, classmates,

1002
00:34:40,870 --> 00:34:41,790
or neighbors?

1003
00:34:42,149 --> 00:34:43,030
I thought the same.

1004
00:34:45,310 --> 00:34:47,069
But if they know each other,

1005
00:34:47,629 --> 00:34:48,749
why act like strangers

1006
00:34:48,830 --> 00:34:49,910
in front of me?

1007
00:34:51,109 --> 00:34:52,430
What does he want?

1008
00:34:52,709 --> 00:34:54,189
I handled a case before

1009
00:34:54,870 --> 00:34:56,069
where one spouse

1010
00:34:56,390 --> 00:34:57,470
used his acquaintances

1011
00:34:57,470 --> 00:34:58,870
to transfer assets
under the guise of loans

1012
00:34:58,870 --> 00:34:59,549
and investments.

1013
00:35:00,510 --> 00:35:01,669
It's very difficult to trace.

1014
00:35:02,470 --> 00:35:03,470
Di Liren

1015
00:35:03,830 --> 00:35:04,990
is trying to use Lu Hui

1016
00:35:06,390 --> 00:35:07,030
to transfer assets?

1017
00:35:07,470 --> 00:35:08,430
Compared to

1018
00:35:08,430 --> 00:35:09,709
our previous assumption,

1019
00:35:09,709 --> 00:35:11,030
I'd say this is more likely.

1020
00:35:11,910 --> 00:35:13,510
That explains why Lu Hui

1021
00:35:13,510 --> 00:35:14,709
mailed you those photos.

1022
00:35:14,830 --> 00:35:15,910
They might have a dispute

1023
00:35:16,069 --> 00:35:17,510
over dividing the spoils.

1024
00:35:17,990 --> 00:35:18,589
They could be

1025
00:35:18,589 --> 00:35:19,910
accomplices in crime,

1026
00:35:20,589 --> 00:35:21,510
or partners

1027
00:35:21,510 --> 00:35:23,149
in an affair.

1028
00:35:25,709 --> 00:35:27,229
This is way too complicated.

1029
00:35:56,549 --> 00:35:57,310
Let him in.

1030
00:36:12,549 --> 00:36:13,189
Mr. Di, hello.

1031
00:36:13,669 --> 00:36:14,669
What can I do for you?

1032
00:36:14,910 --> 00:36:15,629
You recognize me?

1033
00:36:15,990 --> 00:36:17,830
You're famous, of course I do.

1034
00:36:20,950 --> 00:36:23,510
I heard you are a nightmare
for live-in husbands,

1035
00:36:24,990 --> 00:36:26,430
specializing in messy divorces

1036
00:36:27,189 --> 00:36:28,109
and expert at

1037
00:36:28,350 --> 00:36:30,790
finding loopholes
to leave scumbags with nothing.

1038
00:36:31,510 --> 00:36:32,069
I'm here

1039
00:36:32,069 --> 00:36:33,510
about a friend's divorce.

1040
00:36:34,189 --> 00:36:34,950
I'd like your help.

1041
00:36:35,950 --> 00:36:36,430
Sure.

1042
00:36:37,109 --> 00:36:37,790
Tell me more.

1043
00:36:38,470 --> 00:36:39,990
I can't tell you specifics.

1044
00:36:40,629 --> 00:36:41,790
I'm not the party involved.

1045
00:36:42,149 --> 00:36:42,950
I don't want to mislead you.

1046
00:36:42,950 --> 00:36:43,790
My friend

1047
00:36:43,790 --> 00:36:44,430
lives abroad.

1048
00:36:44,830 --> 00:36:45,310
Of course,

1049
00:36:46,430 --> 00:36:47,109
he registered

1050
00:36:47,149 --> 00:36:47,950
his marriage here.

1051
00:36:48,310 --> 00:36:48,790
Don't worry.

1052
00:36:49,430 --> 00:36:50,910
He wants to talk to you in person.

1053
00:36:51,470 --> 00:36:51,990
I wonder

1054
00:36:52,510 --> 00:36:53,310
if you accept.

1055
00:36:54,830 --> 00:36:56,269
Abroad is too far.

1056
00:36:56,629 --> 00:36:58,030
I have plenty of cases on my plate.

1057
00:37:00,109 --> 00:37:01,669
A high-profile lawyer like you

1058
00:37:02,269 --> 00:37:03,549
must have assistants.

1059
00:37:04,510 --> 00:37:05,229
Take this case

1060
00:37:05,990 --> 00:37:07,990
as a paid vacation.

1061
00:37:08,950 --> 00:37:10,044
Flights and hotels covered.

1062
00:37:10,430 --> 00:37:12,350
Retainer fees won't be an issue.

1063
00:37:15,709 --> 00:37:16,350
How much?

1064
00:37:18,030 --> 00:37:18,629
Your call.

1065
00:37:19,629 --> 00:37:20,510
My friend just

1066
00:37:20,749 --> 00:37:21,709
wants the issue solved.

1067
00:37:22,069 --> 00:37:22,629
You can

1068
00:37:22,990 --> 00:37:23,629
name any price.

1069
00:37:26,629 --> 00:37:28,350
That's a hard offer to reject.

1070
00:37:29,589 --> 00:37:30,470
But I reject.

1071
00:37:33,030 --> 00:37:34,430
May I ask why?

1072
00:37:35,709 --> 00:37:37,510
I take cases based on my mood,

1073
00:37:38,189 --> 00:37:38,830
not money.

1074
00:37:41,109 --> 00:37:41,669
Alright then.

1075
00:37:42,790 --> 00:37:43,549
I'll take my leave.

1076
00:37:47,030 --> 00:37:47,790
Mr. Jiao,

1077
00:37:47,830 --> 00:37:48,990
you don't play by the rules.

1078
00:37:50,870 --> 00:37:51,910
I've never seen

1079
00:37:51,950 --> 00:37:53,149
a claw machine

1080
00:37:53,549 --> 00:37:54,510
in a law office.

1081
00:37:59,390 --> 00:38:00,830
Lawyers have to deal with

1082
00:38:00,830 --> 00:38:02,109
dirty human

1083
00:38:02,990 --> 00:38:03,629
nature.

1084
00:38:05,269 --> 00:38:06,310
A claw machine

1085
00:38:06,549 --> 00:38:07,430
helps me calm my mind.

1086
00:38:08,229 --> 00:38:09,669
Then you need more experiences.

1087
00:38:10,749 --> 00:38:11,629
For a lawyer,

1088
00:38:12,390 --> 00:38:14,189
being shortsighted is a fatal flaw.

1089
00:38:27,109 --> 00:38:27,510
He left.

1090
00:38:31,990 --> 00:38:32,870
Oh, no!

1091
00:38:35,749 --> 00:38:36,749
Di Liren must know

1092
00:38:36,790 --> 00:38:37,830
you're my lawyer.

1093
00:38:38,510 --> 00:38:39,350
He's on guard now.

1094
00:38:39,629 --> 00:38:40,870
Then catching him red-handed

1095
00:38:41,030 --> 00:38:41,669
will be harder.

1096
00:38:43,149 --> 00:38:44,350
I have to find a way

1097
00:38:44,510 --> 00:38:45,709
to distract him.

1098
00:38:46,189 --> 00:38:47,830
Then he should be the one sweating,

1099
00:38:48,629 --> 00:38:49,870
because I'm your lawyer.

1100
00:38:54,269 --> 00:38:54,830
Play a round.

1101
00:38:58,910 --> 00:38:59,629
Which one?

1102
00:39:01,069 --> 00:39:01,510
That one.

1103
00:39:01,950 --> 00:39:03,549
The smug one that looks just like you.

1104
00:39:05,589 --> 00:39:06,390
I'm not smug,

1105
00:39:06,910 --> 00:39:07,910
but confident.

1106
00:39:14,589 --> 00:39:16,030
So close!

1107
00:39:16,709 --> 00:39:17,510
Give me more coins.

1108
00:39:18,669 --> 00:39:19,589
Ten yuan for three.

1109
00:39:19,870 --> 00:39:21,390
WeChat Pay or Alipay?

1110
00:39:24,549 --> 00:39:25,950
You're not just smug,

1111
00:39:26,189 --> 00:39:27,589
but also a rip-off artist.

1112
00:39:28,229 --> 00:39:28,870
Done playing.

1113
00:39:31,549 --> 00:39:32,390
Stingy.

1114
00:39:34,430 --> 00:39:35,549
Use your connections

1115
00:39:35,709 --> 00:39:36,390
to dig up more

1116
00:39:36,390 --> 00:39:37,350
about Lu Hui's past.

1117
00:39:40,269 --> 00:39:41,149
I'll think of a way.

1118
00:39:42,910 --> 00:39:43,741
Where are you going?

1119
00:39:44,310 --> 00:39:45,470
I have to meet a client.

1120
00:39:45,510 --> 00:39:46,149
Give you a ride.

1121
00:39:47,709 --> 00:39:48,269
No need.

1122
00:39:48,589 --> 00:39:49,651
I'll go to the hospital.

1123
00:39:50,069 --> 00:39:51,229
People from the company came.

1124
00:39:51,629 --> 00:39:53,629
There's probably a major decision

1125
00:39:53,629 --> 00:39:54,790
waiting for Dad's signature.

1126
00:39:55,390 --> 00:39:56,669
Since he stepped down,

1127
00:39:56,790 --> 00:39:58,109
he only trusts Di Liren.

1128
00:39:58,390 --> 00:39:59,189
I need to be there,

1129
00:39:59,709 --> 00:40:00,669
so the signing

1130
00:40:00,910 --> 00:40:02,030
doesn't become a formality.

1131
00:40:02,350 --> 00:40:03,709
Aside from Dong Jun,

1132
00:40:04,189 --> 00:40:05,430
who else is close to you?

1133
00:40:05,910 --> 00:40:07,950
I know all the executives,

1134
00:40:08,430 --> 00:40:09,430
but not very well.

1135
00:40:10,030 --> 00:40:11,589
Probably just Mr. Tian.

1136
00:40:13,069 --> 00:40:14,109
Mr. Tian and Dad

1137
00:40:14,229 --> 00:40:15,470
have been friends for decades.

1138
00:40:15,749 --> 00:40:17,229
They co-founded Jiali,

1139
00:40:17,629 --> 00:40:19,030
and hold the majority shares.

1140
00:40:20,390 --> 00:40:21,310
Later, Mr. Dong

1141
00:40:21,310 --> 00:40:22,549
joined them

1142
00:40:22,549 --> 00:40:23,381
as a core executive.

1143
00:40:23,669 --> 00:40:24,749
With Dad and Mr. Tian,

1144
00:40:24,910 --> 00:40:25,910
they formed a tight trio.

1145
00:40:26,549 --> 00:40:28,189
Even though Mr. Tian and I

1146
00:40:28,189 --> 00:40:29,189
barely see each other,

1147
00:40:29,709 --> 00:40:31,269
we're still quite close.

1148
00:40:31,709 --> 00:40:33,149
After all, he watched me grow up.

1149
00:40:37,589 --> 00:40:38,189
Mr. Tian.

1150
00:40:42,069 --> 00:40:42,549
Liren.

1151
00:40:42,950 --> 00:40:43,549
Mr. Tian.

1152
00:40:43,870 --> 00:40:44,269
Why

1153
00:40:44,269 --> 00:40:45,910
do you look much thinner?

1154
00:40:48,765 --> 00:40:51,471
=The Vanishing Beauty=
(Next Episode Preview)

1155
00:40:51,870 --> 00:40:52,430
Would

1156
00:40:52,430 --> 00:40:53,910
I lose Jiali?

1157
00:40:54,269 --> 00:40:55,310
No way.

1158
00:40:55,790 --> 00:40:57,430
Your dad is Jiali's biggest shareholder.

1159
00:40:57,669 --> 00:40:58,830
The shares he holds

1160
00:40:59,030 --> 00:41:00,069
are more than Mr. Tian's.

1161
00:41:00,229 --> 00:41:00,950
Did you know Di Liren

1162
00:41:00,950 --> 00:41:01,589
(Chairman: Di Liren)
changed his name?

1163
00:41:02,430 --> 00:41:03,310
Formerly Fang Yong,

1164
00:41:03,549 --> 00:41:04,189
as in Bravery.

1165
00:41:04,870 --> 00:41:05,629
What did you find?

1166
00:41:06,310 --> 00:41:07,669
Di Liren, formerly Fang Yong,

1167
00:41:07,910 --> 00:41:09,549
was once Lu Hui's husband.

1168
00:41:10,749 --> 00:41:11,430
(Without me,)
I sent you the proof.

1169
00:41:11,430 --> 00:41:11,868
(Mom and Dad would be happier)

1170
00:41:12,589 --> 00:41:14,030
So from the very beginning,

1171
00:41:14,709 --> 00:41:15,510
he was lying to me.

1172
00:41:15,830 --> 00:41:16,990
I lent you out.

1173
00:41:17,549 --> 00:41:18,749
We are the real family.

1174
00:41:19,830 --> 00:41:20,470
Four years.

1175
00:41:23,229 --> 00:41:23,990
It's a deal.

1176
00:41:35,716 --> 00:41:39,148
♪We are broken butterflies♪

1177
00:41:39,425 --> 00:41:42,280
♪Can't fly beyond the boundary of fate♪

1178
00:41:42,649 --> 00:41:45,477
♪Wings torn apart by the night♪

1179
00:41:45,477 --> 00:41:49,292
♪Still seeking open fields in the ruins♪

1180
00:41:49,292 --> 00:41:50,933
♪Locked inside a pendulum♪

1181
00:41:50,933 --> 00:41:52,638
♪Repeating the same fate♪

1182
00:41:52,638 --> 00:41:54,066
♪I hear high heels♪

1183
00:41:54,066 --> 00:41:55,835
♪Crushing silent replies♪

